  "description": "AgentBlast — programmable LLM client for .NET, plus the directing layer (knowledge blocks, prompt builder, audit log) that turns a raw chat completion into a steerable agent. Sibling to NetworkBlast / AzureBlast in the Blast family. Named connections resolved through a pluggable Func<category, key, ct, Task<string>> secret resolver, so callers stay decoupled from any vault implementation. Anthropic provider in the box; OpenAI / Ollama planned.",
